OL,5,G2000 Casualty 24/7: Every Second Counts
OL,6,     FAt Barnsley casualty, a man runs
OL,7,     Fin with a major stab wound,
OL,8,     F91-year-old Brenda has had a nasty
OL,9,     Ffall, and five-year-old Greyson
OL,10,     Fhas swallowed a marble.
OL,11,G2100 A&E After Dark
OL,12,     FAfter a terrible accident on his
OL,13,     Fbike, a man has an excruciating
OL,14,     Ftear on his chin. A man is rushed
OL,15,     Fin, escorted by police with a
OL,16,     Fsuspected overdose. A cyclist has
OL,17,     Fbeen hit by a car.
