OL,12,G2300 Skin A&E
OL,13,     FDr Emma meets a man with a strange
OL,14,     Flooking lump on his arm. There's
OL,15,     Fan odd ear lump for Dr Magnus,
OL,16,     Fexploding head cysts for Dr Adil
OL,17,     Fand a large leg lump on a dance
OL,18,     Fteacher for Dr Dev.
